    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Currently, Eutolant Saga will be available in Japanese only. Future localization plans are undecided.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Path of Domination or Liberation? \u2014 A Classic Fantasy SRPG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A peaceful nation engulfed in war. You are an apprentice knight who rises to face this crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the princess in escaping the advancing army, rally your allies, and travel across the world to reclaim your homeland.<br>In a meticulously crafted fantasy world, <strong>only you can command the battlefield, strategize, and restore peace to the continent!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470020/extras/320e08e7dabe726e59b9318800938c59.avif?t=1754347354\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Simple Yet Strategic System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Fast-paced turn-based battles with no screen transitions!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Form a party of over 40 unique allies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Characters' stats grow randomly!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Special items available to support struggling characters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>No permadeath\u2014no need to reset!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Even without permadeath, injuries carry consequences!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470020/extras/109a5e9a3e71e1df693d11a3453035e9.avif?t=1754347354\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lively Character Interactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A war chronicle brought to life by nearly <strong>150 unique characters</strong>,<br>blending <strong>moments of deep drama with lighthearted banter!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>a rich and engaging script</strong>, the story unfolds through lively interactions and dynamic character dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470020/extras/f5e6a2fc82ed8e9a84475c29d450b442.avif?t=1754347354\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Mouse Operation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse operation is only supported when the resolution is set to 1920x1080px.<br>If you wish to use the mouse in fullscreen mode, please contact us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will provide additional instructions, but please note that the window size cannot be changed,<br>and there may be side effects such as the screen being stretched to fit the monitor size.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resolution Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports <strong>1920x1080px and Full Screen mode only</strong>.<br>If playing on a <strong>1920x1080px monitor</strong>, press <strong>F4</strong> to switch to Full Screen mode for the best experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note for Steam Deck Users</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game uses <strong>MP4 format</strong> for in-game videos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Steam Deck, videos may not play correctly <strong>unless your environment supports MP4 playback</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please ensure that your Steam Deck setup can handle MP4 files if you wish to view all video content properly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recommended Users</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of Fantasy Worlds</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovers of Traditional SRPGs</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoyers of Character Interactions</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Currently, Eutolant Saga will be available in Japanese only. Future localization plans are undecided.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Path of Domination or Liberation? \u2014 A Classic Fantasy SRPG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A peaceful nation engulfed in war. You are an apprentice knight who rises to face this crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the princess in escaping the advancing army, rally your allies, and travel across the world to reclaim your homeland.<br>In a meticulously crafted fantasy world, <strong>only you can command the battlefield, strategize, and restore peace to the continent!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470020/extras/320e08e7dabe726e59b9318800938c59.avif?t=1754347354\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Simple Yet Strategic System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Fast-paced turn-based battles with no screen transitions!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Form a party of over 40 unique allies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Characters' stats grow randomly!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Special items available to support struggling characters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>No permadeath\u2014no need to reset!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Even without permadeath, injuries carry consequences!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470020/extras/109a5e9a3e71e1df693d11a3453035e9.avif?t=1754347354\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lively Character Interactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A war chronicle brought to life by nearly <strong>150 unique characters</strong>,<br>blending <strong>moments of deep drama with lighthearted banter!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>a rich and engaging script</strong>, the story unfolds through lively interactions and dynamic character dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470020/extras/f5e6a2fc82ed8e9a84475c29d450b442.avif?t=1754347354\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Mouse Operation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse operation is only supported when the resolution is set to 1920x1080px.<br>If you wish to use the mouse in fullscreen mode, please contact us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will provide additional instructions, but please note that the window size cannot be changed,<br>and there may be side effects such as the screen being stretched to fit the monitor size.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resolution Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports <strong>1920x1080px and Full Screen mode only</strong>.<br>If playing on a <strong>1920x1080px monitor</strong>, press <strong>F4</strong> to switch to Full Screen mode for the best experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note for Steam Deck Users</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game uses <strong>MP4 format</strong> for in-game videos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Steam Deck, videos may not play correctly <strong>unless your environment supports MP4 playback</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please ensure that your Steam Deck setup can handle MP4 files if you wish to view all video content properly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recommended Users</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of Fantasy Worlds</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovers of Traditional SRPGs</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoyers of Character Interactions</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Liberate the Fallen Kingdom and Ignite a New Hope! A classic fantasy SRPG featuring a simple system and a cast of captivating characters woven into an epic tale.",
